WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:06.298
Journey eight: request a quote. A member describes a job and asks a

00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:10.850
business for a quote. This run finishes what was left.

00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:16.605
Joanna keeps a phone number on her profile, on the account page.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:21.403
On a business's page, Ask opens the quote dialog.

00:00:21.403 --> 00:00:25.047
Phone is now already filled in from her profile.

00:00:25.047 --> 00:00:30.284
The hint says it is shared with this business, for this request only.

00:00:30.998 --> 00:00:36.681
She describes what she needs. For this job she gives another number, and

00:00:36.681 --> 00:00:38.102
sends the request.

00:00:39.555 --> 00:00:44.973
The request is sent, and the owner's quote arrives in her messages.

00:00:44.973 --> 00:00:46.995
Jubilee takes no payment.

00:00:48.124 --> 00:00:52.567
Back on her account, the profile still holds her own number.

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:55.900
The other number went with that request only.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:01.821
Behind the screen, the number comes with the dialog's options, from the

00:01:01.821 --> 00:01:06.525
member's own profile. The owner gets a notification and an e-mail.

00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:11.586
The member is told when the owner confirms or declines, and the request

00:01:11.586 --> 00:01:15.720
is a card in their conversation. The tests prove each one.

00:01:16.599 --> 00:01:22.143
Journey eight is complete. Nothing is left for the owner to do.
